title: Constitutional Reform
subtitle: A New Ruusan: entrench the Senate's safeguards in the constitution.
is-card: true
tags: senate_affairs
card-image: img/card_law.svg
view-if: constitution_timer <= 0 and rc_in_govt and (chair_judiciary = "rc" or rc_chancellor) and cardok_constitution
on-arrival: amend_threshold = 66.7 if faith < 60; amend_threshold = 60 if faith >= 60; turn_actions += 1; constitution_timer = 3; last_card_timer = "constitution"
new-page: true

= Constitutional Reform

Constitutional amendments need **two-thirds** of the Senate (three-fifths if faith in the Republic is 60 or more, because the member worlds can be asked to ratify them), and delegations on the Chancellery's payroll vote against anything that limits it. Each attempt costs 1 political capital, whether it passes or not. Senate resolve ([+ senate_resolve : resolve +]) and faith in the Republic ([+ faith : faith +]) make reform easier.

- @sunset: Sunset clauses on all emergency powers.
- @terms: Entrench the Chancellor's term limit.
- @vonc: A constructive vote of no confidence.
- @jedi: Guarantee the independence of the Jedi Order.
- @rim: Constitutional seats for the Outer Rim.
- @groundwork: Build support for a future amendment.
- @easy_discard

@sunset
view-if: not emergency_sunset
subtitle: Emergency powers will lapse unless the Senate renews them every year.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: {!
Q.capital -= 1;
var st = SW.stance(Q, {mod: 0.6, guild: 0.55, rim: 0.65, sec: 0.25, ind: 0.6, pal: 0.15 + (Q.emergency_powers < 1 ? 0.25 : 0), cis: 0.6}, true);
Q.cr_vote = SW.vote(Q, st, 1, 'oversight');
Q.vote_html = SW.voteBanner('Sunset Amendment', Q.cr_vote, Q.amend_threshold);
if (Q.cr_vote >= Q.amend_threshold) { Q.emergency_sunset = 1; Q.faith += 1; this.achieve('sunset'); }
!}

[+ vote_html +]

[? if emergency_sunset : From now on, every emergency power granted to the Chancellor expires after a year unless the Senate votes to renew it. ?][? if not emergency_sunset : The amendment fails. ?]

@terms
view-if: not term_limits_protected
subtitle: No Chancellor's term could ever be extended, emergency or not.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: {!
Q.capital -= 1;
var st = SW.stance(Q, {mod: 0.65, guild: 0.5, rim: 0.65, sec: 0.35, ind: 0.6, pal: (Q.pal_chancellor ? 0.05 : 0.4), cis: 0.6}, true);
Q.cr_vote = SW.vote(Q, st, 1, 'oversight');
Q.vote_html = SW.voteBanner('Term Limits Amendment', Q.cr_vote, Q.amend_threshold);
if (Q.cr_vote >= Q.amend_threshold) { Q.term_limits_protected = 1; Q.faith += 1; }
!}

[+ vote_html +]

[? if term_limits_protected : The Chancellor's two-term limit is now beyond the reach of any emergency. ?][? if not term_limits_protected : The amendment fails. ?]

@vonc
view-if: not constructive_vonc
subtitle: A government can only be brought down if the Senate agrees on its replacement. More stable coalitions.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: {!
Q.capital -= 1;
var st = SW.stance(Q, {mod: 0.7, guild: 0.45, rim: 0.45, sec: 0.5, ind: 0.55, pal: 0.3, cis: 0.3}, true);
Q.cr_vote = SW.vote(Q, st, 1, 'oversight');
Q.vote_html = SW.voteBanner('Constructive No-Confidence Amendment', Q.cr_vote, Q.amend_threshold);
if (Q.cr_vote >= Q.amend_threshold) { Q.constructive_vonc = 1; Q.coalition_dissent -= 1; }
!}

[+ vote_html +]

[? if constructive_vonc : Governments will no longer fall to paralysis and procedural ambush. Nobody can do to a future Chancellor what was done to Valorum. ?][? if not constructive_vonc : The amendment fails. ?]

@jedi
view-if: not jedi_independence
subtitle: The Jedi Council could never be placed under the Chancellor's authority.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: {!
Q.capital -= 1;
var st = SW.stance(Q, {mod: 0.6, guild: 0.4, rim: 0.55, sec: 0.25, ind: 0.6, pal: 0.15, cis: 0.4}, true);
st.mod += (Q.jedi_standing - 50) / 200; st.ind += (Q.jedi_standing - 50) / 200;
Q.cr_vote = SW.vote(Q, st, 1, 'oversight');
Q.vote_html = SW.voteBanner('Jedi Independence Amendment', Q.cr_vote, Q.amend_threshold);
if (Q.cr_vote >= Q.amend_threshold) { Q.jedi_independence = 1; Q.jedi_relation += 10; }
!}

[+ vote_html +]

[? if jedi_independence : The Order's independence is written into the constitution. No Chancellor may appoint its Council or direct its Knights. ?][? if not jedi_independence : The amendment fails. ?]

@rim
view-if: not rim_enfranchised
subtitle: Permanent constitutional seats for the Outer Rim.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: {!
Q.capital -= 1;
var st = SW.stance(Q, {mod: 0.35, guild: 0.25, rim: 0.95, sec: 0.2, ind: 0.6, pal: 0.35, cis: 0.75}, true);
Q.cr_vote = SW.vote(Q, st, 1, 'rim');
Q.vote_html = SW.voteBanner('Rim Representation Amendment', Q.cr_vote, Q.amend_threshold);
if (Q.cr_vote >= Q.amend_threshold) { Q.rim_enfranchised = 1; Q.outer_sep -= 10; Q.midrim_sep -= 6; Q.rim_relation += 10; Q.outer_rc += 3; this.achieve('enfranchised'); }
!}

[+ vote_html +]

[? if rim_enfranchised : The Outer Rim gains permanent seats and a constitutional voice. ?][? if not rim_enfranchised : The amendment fails. ?]

@groundwork
subtitle: Free. Makes future constitutional votes a little easier.
on-arrival: new_ruusan += 1; senate_resolve += 0.3

The Caucus circulates draft amendments and gathers co-sponsors.
